e for Lojban as consensually conceived of by the Lojbo community. My presen=
t involvement here is largely altruistic, born of goodwill and immensely hi=
gh regard for some jbopre, and I have long been resigned to the fact that L=
ojban will never metamorphosize into the language I'd like it to have been =
